# Everything here is excluded from a deploy.
#
# Vercel turns every file in api/ into a public endpoint. A CLI deploy
# (`vercel deploy --prebuilt`) uploads the working tree, not just what git
# tracks, so an untracked scratch file left in api/ becomes a second live
# endpoint that drifts out of sync with the audited one. That nearly happened:
# a 64 KB instrumented copy of convert.js sat in api/ for a while. It escaped
# only because Vercel treats an underscore prefix as private.
#
# Nothing below is needed at runtime.

# Test harnesses and scratch scripts
test-*.mjs
audit-*.mjs
*.test.mjs
gen_report.cjs

# Sample invoices and generated workbooks — never ship customer data
*.pdf
*.xlsx
*.xls

# Notes and local tooling
PROJECT-BLUEPRINT.md
.claude/

# Anything explicitly marked as not-for-deploy
api/_*
